Propolis
Copyright 2022 Oxide Computer Company
Licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0.
https://github.com/oxidecomputer/propolis

This project is built on Propolis. The bhyve and viona kernel ioctl
bindings, the address space manager, the PS/2 keyboard and controller
models, and parts of the PCI, UART, and VM-exit layers are copied from
or derived from it.

Measured against Propolis b428c40efae0be950e996f9dfd5ab8d02db59184:
19 files at or above 30% similarity, 3300 significant lines, of which 6
are essentially verbatim. Each such file carries a header naming its
upstream counterpart. THIRD_PARTY.md lists every file with its measured
similarity, and tools/propolis-derivation.py regenerates that list.
Individual files retain their MPL Exhibit A headers.

